      "value": "@{5e8487f1fd13be66cecc227b|full_name}: Ah, I see the confusion! The docs are in fact incorrect here, only the receiver behaviour must not be SyncType None. The sender type is actually irrelevant.\n\nI will adjust the documentation accordingly.\n\nWith that in mind, is there still unexplained behaviour or a bug, or does that clear it up?",
